orning?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"7\" id=\"a7\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/B1T2_L7A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/B1T2_L7B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/B1T2_L7C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div>"},{"title":"Part 2","nums":[8,9,10,11,12,13],"built":true,"questions":"<p class=\"inst\"><i>For each question, choose the correct answer.</i></p><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a boy telling a friend about plans for his birthday.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q8\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">8</span> How does he feel about the plans he’s made?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"8\" id=\"a8\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>annoyed that some of his friends don’t want to come</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>disappointed that he can’t invite more friends</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>worried that it might be boring for his friends</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear two friends talking about a football match they went to.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q9\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">9</span> They both think that</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"9\" id=\"a9\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>the crowd was smaller than usual.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>the match was quite boring.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>the referee made some bad decisions.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a man telling his friend about a skiing holiday.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q10\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">10</span> How did he feel during the holiday?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"10\" id=\"a10\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>upset that he was injured</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>embarrassed by his skiing ability</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>angry that his friends put photos online</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear two friends talking about cars.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q11\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">11</span> The woman thinks the best way to get information about new cars is from</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"11\" id=\"a11\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>advertisements.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>TV programmes.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>internet reviews.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a woman telling a friend about a singing competition.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q12\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">12</span> What does the woman say about it?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"12\" id=\"a12\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>Judging it is the easiest part.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>It is taking a long time to organise it.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>She would love to perform in it.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a woman talking to a friend about her recent move to a city.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q13\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">13</span> How does the woman feel about it?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"13\" id=\"a13\" tabindex=\"-1\"><bu